{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43953","headline":"闻琴 · 孙氏","name":"闻琴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉指朱弦轧复清，湘妃愁怨最难听。\n初疑飒飒凉风劲，又似萧萧暮雨零。\n近比流泉来碧嶂，远如玄鹤下青冥。\n夜深弹罢堪惆怅，露湿丛兰月满庭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43953.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43953","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}